%N A126497 Number of base 29 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by three or less.
%C A126497 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+7^(n-1) for base>=3n-2; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+7^(n-1)-2 when base=3n-3
%H A126497 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126497 <a href="/index/Rec#order_15">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (16,-74,12,531,-377,-1407,827,1651,-678,-862,230,171,-27,-7,1).
%o A126497 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>3)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>3))
